2 CONT Hints show father as Lars Pehrsson and son named Peter in 10-1-1761.  Found them in Gullmark Bydgeå, Västerbottens at v139095.b35.s81 and 1771 - 1781 at v139096.b42.s28. Found as father and son at v139096.b10.s174 in 1777. Found a
2 CONC s father and daughter (Magdalena) v139096.b10.s174 in 1776. Found Father and another son (Lars) at v139096.b13.s177 in 1780. Found with family at v139097.b42.s34 in 1784 - 1797.
