1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He marries well to become bonde at Djäkneboda 4 and 5. His boys make out good too, through marriage. Shown as kiki 238. He married Brita Jonsdotter and they had six children, Abraham b. 1692, Brita 1693, Jon 1699 (
2 CONC our ancestor), Anders 1702, Anna 1703, and Per 1707.
2 CONT
2 CONT Court Judgment Book (Dombok): Dmb 1695 17/4: Anders Abrahamsson, in Djäkneboda, who is now proven to have stolen last December from Nils Olofsson in Bäck; 23d 17 öre, was fined triple..
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 20 person 162356, https://kråken.se/ gives source as HFL for birth and death, communion record Djkneboda, Bygdeå DII:1.3 (1726-53).
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå byar och gårdar 1600 - 1800" (2006),  p.116, Sjulsmark 3 (son), p. 58, Djäkneboda 4; Dombok entries.
2 CONT Kurt Andersson, https://www.qhurth.com/anor/0001/41004.htm
