2 CONT Barn:  Jonas Gustaf Johansson (1794 - 1857)  Peter (1795 - 1796)  Catharina (1797 - 1797)  Petrus (Peter) (1798 - 1798)  Olaus (Olof) (1799 - 1799)  Brita Catharina Johansdotter (1800 - )  Johan Johansson Frimodig (1802 - 1864)  M
