2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT Owner (Bonde) of farm #5 in Djäkneboda 5 farm, Bygdeå. He has no sons, so he passes his farm on to his eldest daughter, Brita, who marries Anders Abrahamsson. Anders takes it over, with marriage, and they pass it on to their heir 
2 CONC (my ancestor Jon Andersson), and succeeding ancestors. Shown as kiki478.
2 CONT
