1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nils f. 1764-10-15 at Bjänsjöå (to Nathanael Hansson + Cecilia Gudmundsdottr).
2 CONT Shown at A1:4.37  (1771-88)  with parents Coeilia G. + Nath. H. +sibs + grandparents @Bjänsfors 1.
2 CONT Residences: listed as Bjänsjöå  / Bjänsjofors / Bjänfors.
2 CONT Lived from 1784 until death of fever as "bonde (owner-farmer) in Åkullsjön," Bygdeå parish.
2 CONT Shown A1:5A.86 (1784+1797) in Åkullsjön farm #1 w/wife+kids.
2 CONT Shown A1:6(1797-1807) in Åkullsjön farm #1 w/wife+kids.
