1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Owner of farm (Bonde) in Kräkånger and Norbyn, Lövänger.
2 CONT The father-in-law of his 1st wife Anna Kristoffersdotter is mentioned in Dombok (Court Judgment Book): 1688 20/2: 3g had Nils Olofsson Svensk invite his father-in-law Christopher Christophersson's . . .
2 CONT He remarries (2) to Karin Andersdotter 1699-01-08, after death of his 1st wife, our ancestor.
2 CONT Shown with wife # 2, Karin, at AI:2.34 (1712-29), Norbyn, Lövänger .
2 CONT Lövänger  död och begravingsbok: 1738 Julius 22 died Nils Olofsson at Nordbyn and buried at the church on 30 ditto [July] at age 84 or 85 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson,  "Lövånger byar och gårdar 1539-1800" (2006), p. 182, Nolbyn 4. Dombok entry. Died 1738-07-22 at 84 or 85 years.
2 CONT Kråken 13 person 92362, https://www.kråken.se/ shows birth and death source C:2.26 (died at 84 or 85 years), household exams Nolbyn, Lövånger AI:2.28 (1712-17), AI:2.83 (1717-22), AI:2.125 (1723-28).
2 CONT
