1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Shown at Intervalle, AI:5.141 (1742-51); moved in 1750 to Bygdeå. Next in Bjännsjöa, Bygdeå, AI:2.55 (1746-62), but NOT shown in Bjännsjöa after father remarries, AI:3.95. She marries Hans L. next door in Bjänsfors
2 CONC , on husband's dad's farm,  AI:3.97.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parish Register citations:  birth A1.3.96 baptised; death 1821-06-10; death C:3.675. Marriage register C:2.170: "28/9 Farmhand (Drang) Nathanael Hansson at Bjänsfors with Mai (Piga) Cecilia Gudmonsdotter from Bjännsjöa." Shown wit
2 CONC h husband's dad, Hans L., and 2nd wife Kjerstin L., at Bjänsfors 1, Bygdeå, next door to own father, step-mom, and siblings, AI:3.97 (1762-72). Shown as Nathalh H.'s wife with kids, and retired in-laws at Bjänsfors 1, Bygdeå, AI:4
2 CONC .37 (1771-1794(.
2 CONT
2 CONT Residences: Bjänfors, Bygdeå; later as widow in Åkullsjön, Bygdeå with daughter Ingrid.
2 CONT Nathaniel H. dies; Cecilia is OK at Åkullsjön 1 farm with son Nils,his wife, and kids, AI:6.81 (1797-1807). Cecilia also lived in Kvarmrödjningen, Bygdeå; she was born in Innertavle, Umeå landsförs.
2 CONT Dödbook: "widow Bjänfors settler Nathaniel Hanson, Cecilia Gudmundsdotter; dead at age 85 in Åkullsjön, Västerbotten (home of her daughter Ingrid).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Bygdeå Parish records: C2.170 (marriage), C3.675 (death), HFL AI.3.96 (1762) (birth).
2 CONT Bygdeå parish HFL, AI:3.96 (1762) (AID: v139095.b43.s97, NAD: SE/HLA/1010025), https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v139095?image=43
2 CONT Bygdeå parish HFL, AI:4.37 (1771-1794) (AID: v139096.b51.s37, NAD: SE/HLA/1010025), https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v139096?image=51
2 CONT Kråken 13 person 144961, https://kråken.se/ gives sources HFL for birth year 1736 and "SLJ" for death. HFL: Bjensjö, Bygdeå AI:2.55 (1755-62) b. 1736. Note says she came from Innertavle Umeå Landsförs.
